                            <comment id="15883911" author="andrew_palumbo" created="Sat, 25 Feb 2017 01:42:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thx andrew.. some strings like that are in OMPMmul.scala and GPUMmul.scala .. they are a decent way of checking to see if the vcl bindings actually executed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Big thing is that needs to be dealt with is the logging in the RootFactorySolver.scala.&lt;br/&gt;
That&apos;s just spoofed and is very verbose.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s also some of the most embarrassing code I&apos;ve written .. using try/catch for logic.. but time is a resource I&apos;m really low on latey.. the real fix for that code is to create a solver once and cache it for the following operations... really not a big deal just to put it into a map...&lt;/p&gt;





